===Etymology===
Uncertain. If the element *''bak-'' is a [[metathesis]] of *''kab-'' (compare French ''[[cabillaud]]'' and German ''[[Kabeljau]]'' from Dutch ''[[kabeljauw]]''), then the original form of the word could have been *''cabalao'', maybe meaning "large-headed fish".

Cognate to Italian {{term|baccalà|lang=it}}, Portuguese {{term|bacalhau|lang=pt}}.

